    - target: {fileID: 5165689444429818722, guid: e3663858f69364148864859e96b481f8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '- Grind wheat with mortar and pestle.

        - Drop flour into bowl
        with some water.

        - Mix, drop spoon and grab some dough.

        -
        Leave dough in oven for 2 minutes.

        - Throw sliced fruit into a pot
        of water.

        - Mix while ingredients are heated.

        - Spread
        the jam on some toast. Done!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
